  "description": "Roslyn analyzer for C# readability. CCCRC001 flags a return expression that exceeds ReturnTypeComplexityAnalyzerMaximum calculation steps (default 1). Arithmetic other than string concatenation, method calls other than nameof, and conditional operators each count as one step. CCCPL001 flags a parameter list that is neither entirely on one line, parentheses included, nor one parameter per line with the closing parenthesis on the following line. CCCPL002 flags a broken parameter list whose parameters still fit in ParameterListFitAnalyzerMaximum characters (default 120). CCCNS001 flags a class, struct, record, interface, enum, or delegate declared outside a namespace. Default severity is warning.",
